{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "分疊既成五種禪，折金無處不垂涎，秪因陸徑皆茅塞，依舊重撐般若船。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拍拍令"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蝶臉蒼鬍纔老叟，一回換面叫孩兒。曲罷帳中無箇事，你是何人我是誰？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性（明　禪）"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "門人慧機曰：「離卻那畔，這裏又\n作麼生？須別具眼始得。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又評"}
